      "summary_sent_score": 0.11691076308488846
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 6,
      "text": "It appears from the materials on record that the appellant herein is the brother-in-law (Jeth) of the deceased.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 738,
      "end": 849,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.30827635526657104
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 7,
      "text": "The deceased was married to one Ram Sajeevan.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 850,
      "end": 895,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Ram Sajeevan",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 882,
          "end": 894
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.5025859475135803
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 8,
      "text": "3. It is the case of the prosecution that there was harassment at the end of the husband, in-laws and the appellant (Jeth) herein to the deceased.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 897,
      "end": 1043,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.36585748195648193
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 9,
      "text": "4. The deceased doused herself with kerosene and set herself on fire on 27-09-1990.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1044,
      "end": 1128,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "27-09-1990",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 1117,
          "end": 1127
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.4094283878803253
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 10,
      "text": "She died on account of severe burn injuries.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1129,
      "end": 1173,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.5404615998268127
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 11,
      "text": "The father of the deceased lodged a First Information Report with the Ajgain Police Station, District Unnao on the very same day.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1174,
      "end": 1303,
      "entities": [
        {
