    {
      "sentence_id": 13,
      "text": "That the father in law Lal Bahadur., S/o. Jugnu, Village Sambhar Kheda, Majra Nana Tikur, P.S. Ajgain,\nDistt. Unnao took my daughter Kusum with him on 25.09.1990.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
