      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.22106274962425232
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 14,
      "text": "That in the intervening night of 26.09.1990 and 27.09.1990 my daughter was killed by burning by her in-laws.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1742,
      "end": 1850,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "26.09.1990",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 1775,
          "end": 1785
        },
        {
          "text": "27.09.1990",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 1790,
          "end": 1800
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.34768998622894287
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 15,
      "text": "Before this they were demanding the buffalo and gold chain in dowry Ram Pyarey vs The State Of Uttar Pradesh on 9 January, 2025 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/179427786/\n1 after marriage.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1851,
      "end": 2051,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Ram Pyarey vs The State Of Uttar Pradesh",
          "label": "PRECEDENT",
          "start": 1919,
          "end": 1959
        },
        {
          "text": "9 January, 2025",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 1963,
          "end": 1978
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.5669221878051758
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 16,
      "text": "And told my daughter Kusum Devi if you will not give the dowry then we will kill you.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2052,
      "end": 2137,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Kusum Devi",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 2073,
          "end": 2083
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.04728328436613083
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 17,
      "text": "They threatened her.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2138,
      "end": 2158,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.16376708447933197
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 18,
      "text": "On that I did not send her to her matrimonial house for one year and on 25.09.1990 my daughter was went to her matrimonial house alongwith her father in law Lal Bahadur, Son of Jugnu.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2159,
      "end": 2342,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "25.09.1990",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 2231,
          "end": 2241
        },
        {
          "text": "Lal Bahadur",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 2316,
          "end": 2327
        },
        {
          "text": "Jugnu",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 2336,
          "end": 2341
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.058743931353092194
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 19,
      "text": "They said that she is our responsibility.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2343,
      "end": 2384,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.11990097910165787
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 20,
      "text": "However, in the intervening night of 26.09.1990 and 27.09.1990 at about 2.00 A.M. Lal Bahadur, S/o. Jugnu, Ram Sajeevan, S/o. Lal Bahadur, Ram Pyare, S/o. Lal Bahadur, Sonawati, W/o. Lal Bahadur killed my daughter Kusum Devi by burning after pouring kerosene oil on her.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2385,
      "end": 2655,
      "entities": [
        {
